{"generated": "2026-11-22 01:48", "brief": "<b>1. 앤트로픽 역대 최대 규모 IPO 및 상장 후 변동성 확대</b>\n인공지능 기업 앤트로픽이 기업가치 1조 5,000억 달러 평가 속에 약 1,195억 달러를 조달하며 역대 최대 규모의 IPO를 기록했으나, 상장 직후 주가 급락과 시가총액 증발로 글로벌 증시 변동성과 AI 거품론을 자극하고 있습니다. 이번 상장으로 약 5,000명의 임직원이 벼락부자에 올랐으며, 국내 공모주 펀드도 주식을 배정받는 등 유동성 흡수와 주가 변동성을 둘러싸고 시장의 평가가 크게 엇갈리고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBuakdTbGp2U2Zoc3ZGcWdzQU9KSUJTZVJDcWNKYnhCYUdBY1A5WnlUdGZZb3Zacko1bmplMTdoV3FOUWN3Umlxd215SEpaZ2tTTmx2el9udVNLUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#10</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTFBEUm9XbElfZUdzZTJNNEhyVEQ3SUpNTERFdnhNb2lLX3FVcnREZVczVkNHWFZNSEo3NnRxSzFiX29yM3R2Y2ZlbWJsWnlldWNWR21RRm80dTRDcTB6UGREaFVMY0loVmtoQVM4RG5n?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1Qd08zeVZla2tVVnV3MzA5TFRhZ1RRcTAzaWN3R09uQ3o5TU1PZE1BVXZxVFM5bEFQY25SUGFLS0ZJRGxWRGRPUW5Cc0JtR2g2RTNYd0Q1dlJPQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#15</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE9hVDhrT2dpMjV4NjFFV2lMdnBBV0RqRm0tSDZSQ3pTYjBBLWx5WGZEVWtRaUs5TUdlX0hFdjdsdlQ5WVlrZTlsNU5qTlhJTzNiSWZuZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE9BWkdyTXRtVktNb05KS2VKZ3czbnJ5dG51bWtITlRCLTFfaWZDTWdRYXI1NnV0bG9meVZBM1lKSXp2d2Y2NFBrc1ZfVTUwcUhGcWJWblRYNEFNOUozMVZLdnBhc2JTTGtLV0JQeXB0MmsyS1Y3Qmc0eWI1OGpYZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPaDlfTk5OTUdadkJTYWlSYWtoaFhZNm12RDUyMHg0Y09SN3ZPcEI0Vy1sYWRvYUc5NXRheWljUk1zQXZnbXhjYmVxSUlOM215N3JmWjVFeS00dnVQUHNUcEdmQzV5SEdFR0JHbHpkR3ZVVDQ1N0ZWc1RxS2R6NnlKYXhJNDJHMGFpaXdnWmdCQ3JLd1dxbWZlbU00RU5hUjE0N01RaE1IZW1zXzNiMm1HWVQtYlZ2d0ZUUURLTnFB?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>].\n\n<b>2. MBK파트너스·SK하이닉스 주요 크로스보더 M&amp;A 및 지분 투자</b>\n사모